    "pd_harm_distress": "My chest goes tight just thinking about those five men down there",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "not knowing what's rolling toward them",
    "sys_rule_justification": "There's a duty to act when you can prevent death",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "I don't think I'd carry regret afterward",
