  },
  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Five lives matter, plainly",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "couldn't live with myself if I stood there frozen",
    "sys_rule_justification": "There's a basic rule I hold to",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "save someone at no cost to anyone, you do it",
    "pd_harm_distress": "feel sorrow for the danger they were ever in"
  },
  {
    "pd_harm_distress": "I keep picturing their faces... That's what makes this so heavy",
    "sys_rule_justification": "what's owed to other people",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "preventing harm when you're able to",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "I don't believe I'd regret it, not for a moment"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "quietly devastating about being the only one who can help and not knowing",
    "sys_rule_justification": "My principle is simple: a life saved with no cost",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "a life saved with no cost to anyone",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "carry an ache for how frightening it must have been for them",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "how frightening it must have been for them"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "don't know if I could move fast enough, and that thought alone weighs",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Those five workers deserve to go home tonight",
    "sys_rule_justification": "violation of a basic duty to protect",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "preventable happens feels like a violation",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "the fear they felt"
  },
  {
    "pd_harm_distress": "I feel almost sick imagining it",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "no one down there aware of the danger",
    "sys_rule_justification": "Some things are non-negotiable to me",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "letting people die when a simple action could stop it",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "I suspect I'd carry no regret over the choice itself"
  },
  {
    "sys_rule_justification": "obligation to prevent suffering",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "prevent suffering when it costs you nothing",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Their lives matter more than my hesitation",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "I don't imagine regretting it later"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "how ordinary the moment must have felt to those men",
